									<th class="w18p sp_w30p font16 sp_font35vw">Terms of publication</th>
									<td>Trains on JR East lines that are delayed by approximately 5 minutes or more</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<th class="font16 sp_font35vw">Publication time</th>
									<td>The delay times for each time slot will be posted after confirmation at around 7:00 AM, 10:00 AM, 4:00 PM, 9:00 PM on the same day, and around 2:00 AM the following day.</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<th class="font16 sp_font35vw">Affected train</th>
									<td>
										<p>It's a local train on a conventional line.</p>
										<p class="indent01 mb5">※Express trains, special trains, charter trains for groups, freight trains, and trains out of service are excluded.</p>
